[statement]
A package with an `install_if` condition that another package depends on is
placed where the walk reaches it as a dependency, before its condition
holds: `b-extra` comes before `a`, and before `b`, which completes its
condition.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:b-extra

P:b-extra
V:1
i:b

P:b
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:b

[request]
a
z

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install b-extra 1
install a 1
install b 1
install z 1
